# UiDialog (modal chrome)

Use shared helpers from `widgets/ui/ui_dialog.dart` for custom `Dialog` content — not raw one-off padding and Cancel rows.

## Shell

- **`uiDialogShow`** — prefer over raw `showDialog`; default **`barrierDismissible: true`** (tap outside = cancel / `null`).
- **`UiDialog`** — zinc panel, 14px radius, border `uiDialogBorder`, default inset `uiDialogInset` (`20,16,12,20` — matches Google asset connect).
- **Close** — **`UiDialogClose`** or **`UiDialogHeader`** (title + close). **No bottom Cancel / Close text buttons** when the only dismiss action is cancel.

## Title vs search

| Pattern | Chrome |
|--------|--------|
| Form / confirm / connect | `UiDialogHeader(title: …)` at top |
| Searchable picker (channels, assets, skills, locale, …) | **`UiDialogSearchHeader`** only — **no separate title** above search; hint carries context (`Search assets…`) |
| Compact list picker | `padding: uiDialogInsetCompact` on `UiDialog` |

## Actions

- Primary action stays bottom-right (`FilledButton`).
- Destructive flows may keep slide-confirm + single danger button; still use top-right close (disabled while busy).

## Exceptions (`barrierDismissible: false`)

- Boot / session gate (`main.dart`)
- Force-update modals
- Full-screen capture flows where accidental dismiss loses work (`ui_staged_shot` when documented)

Do not set `barrierDismissible: false` on ordinary forms, pickers, or confirms.

## Examples

- Asset URL connect: `io_google_asset_connect.dart` (`UiDialogHeader` + fields)
- Search picker: `io_ask_items.dart` (`UiDialogSearchHeader`)
- Confirm: `ask_confirm.dart` (`UiDialogHeader` + one confirm button)
